2
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:48,550
迷いの森にあるほんとう
The truth hidden in the forest of hesitation...

3
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:52,250
探しに行く月のひかり
Searching for the light of the moon,

4
00:03:52,450 --> 00:03:57,450
羊歯を踏んで足を濡らして ひたりほとり夏の小道
Stepping on ferns and wetting my feet, on the quiet, damp summer path.

5
00:03:57,750 --> 00:04:03,350
よく笑って泣いて見つめあって おそるおそる恋に堕ちた
Laughing, crying, and staring at each other, fearfully falling in love.

6
00:04:03,550 --> 00:04:08,150
ふたり歩き出した違う方へ 呼び合う声だけもどかしく
The two of us started walking in different directions, frustrated by only hearing each other's voices.

7
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:17,000
Find me in the wonderland

8
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:32,200
そろそろ手を汚して 自分の欲しいものを追いかけてみる
It's about time to soil my hands and chase after what I truly desire.

9
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:42,200
みつあみをほどいて 同じ星を齧る ふたりになる
Unbraiding my hair, becoming two people who bite into the same star.

10
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:47,800
寂しがって夜になって まだ明るい夢のほとり
Feeling lonely as night falls, at the edge of a still-bright dream,

11
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:52,800
食べかけで残した心だって ここから始まるうたになる
Even the heart I left half-eaten becomes a song starting right here.

12
00:05:00,268 --> 00:05:05,128
世界は君のものさ どこへ行こうか 貴方は笑う
The world is yours, wherever shall we go, you smile and say,

13
00:05:06,248 --> 00:05:10,148
踏み外してみようか 後ろめたさが
Shall we take a misstep, with the guilt

14
00:05:10,148 --> 00:05:14,928
私を誘う Find me in the wonderland
luring me on? Find me in the wonderland.

15
00:05:32,408 --> 00:05:36,168
どうしたって 生まれ変わる
No matter what, being reborn

16
00:05:36,788 --> 00:05:43,608
強い意志が必要だわ 慎重ないのちだった
A strong will is needed. It was a cautious life.

17
00:05:44,008 --> 00:05:48,808
私だけじゃ道は見つからない 星を数え繋ぎ合わせ
I can't find the way alone. Counting and connecting the stars,

18
00:05:51,808 --> 00:05:55,808
まだ知らない 夏の星座
a summer constellation we don't know yet.

19
00:05:56,408 --> 00:06:02,808
見つめあって泣いて朝になって ここから始まる物語
Gazing at each other, crying, until morning—the story begins here.

20
00:06:03,208 --> 00:06:08,808
もう一人じゃないのよ 夢のようでしょ 私は歌う
You're not alone anymore, isn't it like a dream? I sing,

21
00:06:11,808 --> 00:06:19,408
寂しさはひるがえり旗の元へと 二人は集う
loneliness flutters as the two gather beneath the flag.

22
00:06:20,408 --> 00:06:27,608
何も思い通りにならないことが 始まったから
Because nothing started going according to plan,

23
00:06:28,008 --> 00:06:36,208
踏み外してみようか 目隠し鬼の 手の鳴る方へ
shall we take a misstep, toward the clapping of blind man's bluff?

24
00:06:37,408 --> 00:06:41,608
In your wonderland

25
00:06:54,808 --> 00:07:01,208
あなたが迷う場所に あかりを灯すために
To light a lamp in the place where you get lost,

26
00:07:02,008 --> 00:07:06,808
花束一つ抱いて りりしく笑いましょう
holding a single bouquet of flowers, let's smile bravely.

27
00:07:09,608 --> 00:07:15,208
もう一人じゃないのよ とても怖いね 幸せなんて
You're not alone anymore, how terrifying true happiness is.

28
00:07:18,008 --> 00:07:25,608
寂しさはひるがえり旗の元へと 二人は集う
loneliness flutters as the two gather beneath the flag.

29
00:07:26,408 --> 00:07:33,208
世界は君のものさ 手が届いて あなたがいて
The world is yours, reaching out with you right here,

30
00:07:34,208 --> 00:07:41,808
踏み外してみようか 愛するひとが 私を誘う
shall we take a misstep, as the one I love invites me

31
00:07:42,208 --> 00:07:46,408
Find me in the wonderland

32
00:07:46,808 --> 00:07:50,008
In your wonderland

33
00:07:54,008 --> 00:08:00,008
綺麗な吐息になって
Becoming a clean breath,

34
00:08:01,808 --> 00:08:06,008
あなたの歌をうたって
singing your song.

35
00:08:39,508 --> 00:08:45,008
[Title: delete]

36
00:08:40,008 --> 00:08:45,008
[Text: Lyrics・Composition: 梶浦由記]
[Text: Lyrics・Composition: Yuki Kajiura]

37
00:08:49,208 --> 00:08:57,208
優しい言葉を 失くした闇の中
In the darkness where I lost gentle words,

38
00:08:59,008 --> 00:09:09,608
最後の祈りも 静かに消えていった 夜明けは遠く
my final prayer also quietly faded away, dawn is far off.

39
00:09:10,008 --> 00:09:18,008
君は一人 出口のない 夢の中で
You are alone inside a dream with no exit,

40
00:09:18,808 --> 00:09:29,208
涙だけが道を照らした 誰にも届かず 朽ちてゆく歌がある
only tears lit the path. There is a song rotting away, reaching no one.

41
00:09:30,008 --> 00:09:42,208
悲しみ一つも叶えられずに終わる 声もなく君はただ泣いた
Ending without even one sorrow being fulfilled, you wept silently without a voice.

42
00:09:46,008 --> 00:09:54,008
君はただ泣いた
You just wept.

43
00:10:01,049 --> 00:10:06,169
優しい言葉を 失くした闇の中
In the darkness where kind words were lost

44
00:10:10,529 --> 00:10:17,489
誰かが数を数えた
Someone counted the numbers

45
00:10:28,109 --> 00:10:36,849
光をもたらす定めの人は来ない
The one destined to bring light won't come

46
00:10:40,109 --> 00:10:46,349
澱んだ時間はまだらに凍りついて
Stagnant time froze in patches

47
00:10:47,349 --> 00:10:53,129
恐れを解いた刃を手に
Holding blades with fear unburdened

48
00:10:53,689 --> 00:10:58,289
抱きしめ合う形をして君と僕は傷を重ねた
In the shape of an embrace, you and I piled our wounds

49
00:11:00,849 --> 00:11:07,949
どこにも届かず君の声は潰えた
Reaching nowhere, your voice faded out

50
00:11:11,209 --> 00:11:18,309
消えてゆくことさえ誰も気づかぬ余り
So much that no one even noticed us fading

51
00:11:19,509 --> 00:11:29,089
無造作に数字を増やした
We carelessly increased the numbers

52
00:11:36,049 --> 00:11:43,109
いつか光の中で
Someday inside the light

53
00:11:46,049 --> 00:11:54,689
傍にいてくれると信じた
Believing you would stay by my side

54
00:12:14,389 --> 00:12:26,529
形のない僕たちは 形のある世界へと
We, who were formless, headed toward a world with form

55
00:12:30,149 --> 00:12:39,169
いつか帰る道を探した 忘れてしまった
Searching for the way back someday, but forgetting...

56
00:12:41,989 --> 00:12:54,509
優しい人の声を探して彷徨う道はどこまで遠い
Searching for the voice of a gentle person, how far does the wandering path go?

57
00:12:55,769 --> 00:13:09,129
声もなく君はただ泣いた 道はやがて途絶えた
Without a voice you simply wept, and the path eventually came to an end

58
00:13:16,909 --> 00:13:25,149
いつか光の中で…
Someday inside the light...

59
00:13:36,149 --> 00:13:46,469
わあ！ Good morning, afternoon, evening! おはよう、こんにちは、こんばんは！ Welcome to my birthday live! Yay!
Wah! Good morning, afternoon, evening! Good morning, afternoon, evening! Welcome to my birthday live! Yay!

60
00:13:46,469 --> 00:13:49,209
It's finally happening!

61
00:13:49,869 --> 00:13:51,709
はあ...
Hah...

62
00:13:51,709 --> 00:14:01,509
Thank you guys for being so patient. I know this was originally planned for around May, around my birthday, but it's finally happening in December!

63
00:14:01,729 --> 00:14:07,709
Thank you so much, everyone, for being patient and supporting me so this could happen.

64
00:14:07,909 --> 00:14:16,649
Thank you so, so much Staff-san for all your hard work! I'm so happy and I'm so nervous, can you tell?

65
00:14:17,389 --> 00:14:29,849
So, did you guys enjoy the first two songs, Wonderland and Delete?

66
00:14:29,849 --> 00:14:36,229
Wonderland is aimer songs, it's not Ina's live without an Aimer song.
Wonderland is an Aimer song, it's not an Ina's live without an Aimer song.

67
00:14:36,449 --> 00:14:44,309
I don't think it's as well known, but it's definitely one of my favorite songs by her, so I wanted to perform it for you guys someday.

68
00:14:44,309 --> 00:14:52,249
And Delete, it's actually an insert song in the Sword Art Online movie Ordinal Scale,

69
00:14:52,249 --> 00:14:58,349
and I really liked the song in the movie, and I, you know, I wanted to perform it for you guys.

70
00:14:58,569 --> 00:15:00,040
Both of them are too...
Both of them are...

71
00:15:00,428 --> 00:15:04,558
Anyways, I hope you'll have a lot of fun during the live.

72
00:15:04,668 --> 00:15:07,208
Let's enjoy our trip through Neverland together.

73
00:15:07,378 --> 00:15:08,438
Never-Everland.

74
00:15:08,598 --> 00:15:09,938
Never-ever-everland.

75
00:15:10,048 --> 00:15:13,088
Never-ever-never-ever-ever-neverland.

76
00:15:13,088 --> 00:15:13,908
Yeah.

77
00:15:13,938 --> 00:15:14,958
Let's go!

78
00:17:18,256 --> 00:17:22,036
ダミーダミー
Dummy dummy

79
00:17:29,716 --> 00:17:35,826
一人じゃ出来ないことを探してみたよ
I tried searching for things I couldn't do alone

80
00:17:36,596 --> 00:17:47,556
二人じゃなきゃ出来ない何かを でもその答えを探せば探すほど 誰かと笑ってる僕を殺したくなる
Something that can't be done unless there are two... But the more I search for that answer, the more I want to kill the me who's smiling with someone else

81
00:17:53,966 --> 00:18:02,186
「1＋1が一番美しいよ」
“1 + 1 is the most beautiful.”

82
00:18:04,326 --> 00:18:16,836
僕はそう思えなくて 誰かに縛られてると消えたくて そんな自分が一番美しいと思った
I couldn't think that way... I wanted to disappear when bound to someone, and thought that self was the most beautiful.

83
00:18:18,616 --> 00:18:24,516
二人で出来ない事がたくさんある 一人で出来る事が多過ぎて
There are so many things we can't do together, and too many things I can do alone

84
00:18:30,366 --> 00:18:38,276
だから僕がもっと大量に必要だよ そして誰かに僕の役を押し付けた
That's why I need much more of myself, and I thrust my role upon someone else

85
00:18:40,016 --> 00:18:46,426
僕の声は一言も葉にならない、なれない だからここで誰かが演じる僕を見てるよ
My voice doesn't become words, not even a single one... So I watch someone else playing me right here

86
00:18:47,906 --> 00:18:55,726
僕はそう思いたくて 誰かが演じる僕が 僕のそれより美しくて輝いてるから
I wanted to think that way, because the me played by someone else shines more beautifully than my own

87
00:18:58,846 --> 00:19:05,536
僕に良く似たアナタに僕をプレゼントするよ
I'll present myself to you, who looks so much like me

88
00:19:05,536 --> 00:19:15,366
いらなくなったら そっと ティッシュにくるんで捨てて
If you don't need me anymore, gently wrap me in tissue and throw me away

89
00:19:17,406 --> 00:19:29,846
代わりに僕が君を演じるよ いらなくなったら ゴムにくるんで捨てるよ
Instead, I will play you. If you don't need me anymore, wrap me in rubber and throw me away

90
00:19:30,146 --> 00:19:44,426
僕に良く似たアナタに僕をプレゼントするよ いらなくなったら そっと ティッシュにくるんで捨てて
I'll present myself to you, who looks so much like me. If you don't need me anymore, gently wrap me in tissue and throw me away

91
00:19:44,426 --> 00:19:59,056
代わりに僕が君を演じるよ いらなくなったら ゴムにくるんで捨てるよ Hey you!
Instead, I will play you. If you don't need me anymore, wrap me in rubber and throw me away, hey you!

92
